    {
      "id": "p-24569",
      "text": "PROJECT: Intelligence on Tap",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-24569"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-24598",
      "text": "An Open Concept for the Future of AI-Native Commercial Relationships",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-24598"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-24667",
      "text": "I want you to build a beautiful, fully functional, publicly shareable website documenting an extensive intellectual and product-design conversation I had with ChatGPT.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-24667"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-24835",
      "text": "Original conversation:\u000b [INSERT LINK TO THIS CHAT HISTORY]",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-24835"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-24894",
      "text": "This conversation is the primary source of truth. Read and reconstruct the relevant discussion, including our original proposals, iterations, objections, philosophical explorations, product mockups, and eventual conclusions.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-24894"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-25119",
      "text": "If you cannot access the full conversation through the link, tell me exactly what is missing. Do not pretend to have reviewed inaccessible material.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-25119"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-25268",
      "text": "1. Purpose",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-25268"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-25279",
      "text": "I developed these ideas organically while thinking about OpenAI’s subscription pricing and responding to Thibault “Tibo” Sottiaux.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-25279"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-25410",
      "text": "What began as a pricing suggestion evolved into something substantially bigger:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-25410"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-25490",
      "text": "From Customer Lifetime Value to Relationship Lifetime Value.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-25490"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-25551",
      "text": "I intend to send this website directly to Tibo as an open intellectual contribution.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-25551"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-25636",
      "text": "This is NOT a sales pitch, investment proposal, or request for employment.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-25636"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-25711",
      "text": "I want to make these ideas freely available for OpenAI and its team to consider, challenge, adapt, or build upon.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-25711"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-25825",
      "text": "The website should feel like an exceptionally thoughtful product and institutional design exploration, not a marketing brochure.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-25825"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-25954",
      "text": "2. Intellectual Scope",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-25954"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-25976",
      "text": "Document the COMPLETE evolution of the relevant discussion, including:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-25976"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26047",
      "text": "A. Intelligence on Tap",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26047"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26070",
      "text": "Why adding another fixed $50 subscription tier may be less compelling than hybrid pricing.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26070"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26161",
      "text": "A $20 base subscription with metered intelligence consumption.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26161"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26224",
      "text": "Dynamic billing based on actual usage.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26224"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26263",
      "text": "The proposed rounding-down mechanism to existing billing tiers.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26263"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26327",
      "text": "Our restaurant analogy: ordering intelligence on tap rather than committing to a token buffet.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26327"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26422",
      "text": "Transparent pricing, customer autonomy, and spending controls.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26422"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26485",
      "text": "Potential revenue expansion versus uncertain profitability.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26485"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26545",
      "text": "B. The Billing Experience",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26545"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26571",
      "text": "Reconstruct our interactive checkout prototype.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26571"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26619",
      "text": "Example:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26619"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26628",
      "text": "Base subscription: $20",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26628"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26651",
      "text": "Metered intelligence: $86.40",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26651"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26680",
      "text": "Subtotal: $106.40",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26680"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26698",
      "text": "Round down to $100 tier: −$6.40",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26698"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26730",
      "text": "Adjusted bill: $100",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26730"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26750",
      "text": "Optional contribution: $0, $1, $5, $10, or any custom amount.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26750"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26812",
      "text": "The prototype should be genuinely interactive.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26812"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26859",
      "text": "Make clear that rounding down is a proposed commercial discount, not conventional metered billing.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26859"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-26958",
      "text": "Also distinguish contributions to OpenAI’s commercial entity from any actual eligible charitable donation destination. Don’t imply charitable deductibility.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-26958"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27115",
      "text": "C. Loyalty Should Compound",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27115"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27142",
      "text": "Why sustained spending matters.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27142"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27174",
      "text": "Why consistent payment behavior matters.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27174"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27215",
      "text": "Customer tenure, loyalty, and account standing.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27215"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27263",
      "text": "Rewards for $200/$500 subscribers.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27263"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27298",
      "text": "Compute allowances, usage flexibility, preferential pricing, and privileges.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27298"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27375",
      "text": "The difference between loyalty scoring and actual credit underwriting.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27375"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27446",
      "text": "Why valuable, reliable customers should feel increasingly appreciated.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27446"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27517",
      "text": "Preserve the core philosophy:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27517"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27547",
      "text": "Customers are kings. Loyalty should compound.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27547"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27593",
      "text": "D. Bidirectional Relationship Building",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27593"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27632",
      "text": "Explore the possibility that a subscription relationship evolves into:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27632"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27703",
      "text": "Compute financing.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27703"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27722",
      "text": "Business development support.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27722"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27752",
      "text": "Strategic introductions.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27752"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27777",
      "text": "Commercial partnerships.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27777"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27802",
      "text": "Startup financing.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27802"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27821",
      "text": "Equity investment.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27821"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27840",
      "text": "Long-term mutual value creation.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27840"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27873",
      "text": "A customer might eventually become an entrepreneur whom OpenAI chooses to support or invest in.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27873"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-27969",
      "text": "E. Connected Personal Intelligence",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-27969"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28004",
      "text": "Explore the implications of customers voluntarily connecting:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28004"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28066",
      "text": "ChatGPT conversation history and memories.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28066"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28109",
      "text": "Financial information.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28109"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28132",
      "text": "Data analytics.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28132"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28148",
      "text": "Gmail and calendars.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28148"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28169",
      "text": "GitHub and code repositories.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28169"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28199",
      "text": "Documents and business records.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28199"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28231",
      "text": "Other authorized plugins and personal or professional information sources.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28231"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28306",
      "text": "Explain how these could help assemble permissioned evidence of a founder’s work, reliability, execution, growth, and commercial potential.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28306"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28445",
      "text": "Distinguish actual existing ChatGPT capabilities from hypothetical future investment workflows.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28445"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28541",
      "text": "Explicitly preserve user consent, selective disclosure, confidentiality, and data ownership. Connecting an app to ChatGPT does not automatically authorize investment teams to access that information.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28541"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28741",
      "text": "F. AI-Native Investment Relationships",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28741"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28779",
      "text": "Explore how a customer’s longitudinal relationship could evolve into a voluntary investor-founder relationship.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28779"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28891",
      "text": "Demonstrate a hypothetical investment evaluation covering:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28891"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28950",
      "text": "Customer history and spending.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28950"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-28981",
      "text": "Payment reliability.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-28981"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29002",
      "text": "Entrepreneurial execution.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29002"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29029",
      "text": "Financial performance.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29029"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29052",
      "text": "Technical artifacts.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29052"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29073",
      "text": "Reasoning and strategic evolution.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29073"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29108",
      "text": "Investment diligence and potential terms.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29108"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29150",
      "text": "Explain how the investor and entrepreneur could BOTH use AI agents to evaluate their respective interests.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29150"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29257",
      "text": "G. Conscious Capitalism and Universal Altruism",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29257"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29304",
      "text": "Connect the commercial architecture to our broader philosophical discussion:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29304"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29381",
      "text": "Transparent transactions.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29381"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29407",
      "text": "Business profitability versus public benefit.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29407"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29453",
      "text": "Trust and reciprocity.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29453"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29476",
      "text": "Economic incentives.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29476"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29497",
      "text": "Voluntary philanthropic contributions.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29497"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29536",
      "text": "Mutually beneficial commercial relationships.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29536"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29582",
      "text": "The potential evolution from extractive relationships toward long-term value creation.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29582"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29669",
      "text": "Don’t turn this into ideological advocacy. Examine the opportunities, tradeoffs, and limitations seriously.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29669"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29777",
      "text": "3. Preserve the Intellectual Journey",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29777"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29814",
      "text": "This is important.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29814"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29833",
      "text": "Do not merely summarize our final conclusions.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29833"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29880",
      "text": "Reconstruct how the ideas evolved.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29880"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29915",
      "text": "Include our disagreements, corrections, counterarguments, and changes of direction.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29915"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-29999",
      "text": "Distinguish among:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-29999"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30018",
      "text": "Original hypotheses.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30018"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30039",
      "text": "Proposed product features.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30039"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30066",
      "text": "Established facts.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30066"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30085",
      "text": "Economic assumptions.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30085"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30107",
      "text": "Unresolved questions.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30107"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30129",
      "text": "Possible future extensions.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30129"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30157",
      "text": "Where possible, link claims and ideas to their original points in the source conversation.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30157"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30248",
      "text": "Avoid inventing quotations, research evidence, or capabilities.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30248"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30312",
      "text": "4. Website Experience",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30312"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30334",
      "text": "Design for a busy, technically sophisticated product executive.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30334"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30398",
      "text": "The experience should have TWO LEVELS.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30398"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30437",
      "text": "Level 1: Executive Overview",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30437"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30465",
      "text": "Readable in approximately 90 seconds.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30465"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30503",
      "text": "Explain the thesis, why it matters, and the most compelling commercial opportunities.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30503"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30589",
      "text": "Level 2: Deep Exploration",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30589"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30615",
      "text": "An organized, interactive knowledge base containing the full intellectual journey, prototypes, economic models, philosophical foundations, and implementation considerations.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30615"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-30789",
      "text": "Suggested navigation:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-30789"
    },
